"},"name":"nextCompany","strict":true},{"description":"End the game. No arguments.","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"endGame","strict":true},{"description":"A direct payment between the bank, players and companies. \"Ana pays Bruno 50\" · \"Carla pays 100 to the bank\".","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"type":"integer"},"from":{"enum":["bank","player:p1","player:p2","player:p3","player:p4","company:SWP","company:HMQ","company:VH","company:ITC","company:SSF","company:LG","company:KR"],"type":"string"},"to":{"enum":["bank","player:p1","player:p2","player:p3","player:p4","company:SWP","company:HMQ","company:VH","company:ITC","company:SSF","company:LG","company:KR"],"type":"string"}},"required":["from","to","amount"],"type":"object"},"name":"transferMoney","strict":true},{"description":"Correct someone's money: add/subtract (delta) or set it (setTo). \"Ana has 520\" · \"add 20 to Bruno\".","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"delta":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"holder":{"enum":["player:p1","player:p2","player:p3","player:p4","company:SWP","company:HMQ","company:VH","company:ITC","company:SSF","company:LG","company:KR"],"type":"string"},"setTo":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["holder","delta","setTo"],"type":"object"},"name":"adjustMoney","strict":true},{"description":"Correct a company's trains after a recording mistake (not a purchase or a discard). remove: the train goes to the supply (bank, with the list price refunded unless amount), to the pool or out of the game (removed). add: give a train from the supply (amount = what it pays, null = nothing). \"the PRR didn't have that two, give it back to the bank\" · \"take the three off the B&O, out of the game\" · \"give the NYC a two for free\".","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"